        {
          "content": "<p>12月16日清晨，柏林水族馆的世界最大的圆柱体水族箱（高达14米）突然爆裂，原因据说是夜间低温造成了玻璃裂痕，1000吨水和1500条热带鱼倾泻而出，淹了一条街。（<a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/dec/16/huge-cylindrical-aquarium-housing-1500-exotic-fish-bursts-in-berlin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">via</a>）</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "via",
              "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/dec/16/huge-cylindrical-aquarium-housing-1500-exotic-fish-bursts-in-berlin"
            }
